OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers arrested after college
OL,4,Alocked down
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive teenagers have been arrested after
OL,7,Fa college in a city centre was placed
OL,8,Fon lockdown.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said armed
OL,11,Fofficers were sent to Swanswell Street,
OL,12,FCoventry, at about 12:40 BST on Tuesday
OL,13,Fafter reports that a firearm was seen.
OL,15,FAn imitation firearm was found by
OL,16,Fofficers and two 18-year-old men, two
OL,17,Fboys aged 17 and a 16-year-old boy were
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of possession of
OL,19,Fa firearm and remain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
