OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers arrested after college
OL,4,Alocked down
OL,5,
OL,6,FGemma Knott, vice principal at Coventry
OL,7,FCollege, said the site carried out its
OL,8,Flockdown procedures following the
OL,9,Fincident outside the Swan Delights
OL,10,FSupermarket and Cafe, located opposite
OL,11,Fthe campus.
